Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within\Nyour dreams, taking aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,for your heart so it would\Nseem Stand tall and read,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,go to hell and jump for\Nparadise Every time dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous We like it serious, serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,oh Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. The balls built between us, they\Nwill show still what we don't know. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,working hard together Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got superpowers. Got to dream.\NDespite the rivalry, Gotta see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It through believing in you.\NThere's even charm in failure. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\NIn the world we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing\Nup Our thought again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're the foolish ones we love.\NWe'll carry on till we see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will rise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core Is\Nagainst myself forevermore Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,let's do it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go The balls filled between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.02,0:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They will show. So what we don't know?\NThat's what we call adventure. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got superpowers. Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry. Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It through believing in you.\NThere's even charm in failure. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Superpowers Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes, with the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I was stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave the weeping\Nto our enemies, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to lose control here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Jean-May?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say something\Nso cold at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you spent the least amount of\Ntime with Pedro doesn't mean that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If we wallow in pity, then\Neven more lives may be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The struggle we face is\None of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro was well aware of the perils.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And was prepared to sacrifice\Nhimself whenever necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,With his deed, he achieved victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemies have suffered a great\Nmany losses since you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This certainly is an\Nunprecedented setback for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And together, your strength has\Ndriven Big Mom into a corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear Pedro's voice\Nechoing inside you, even now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's saying, onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,luffy took notice\Nimmediately that's why he
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,leapt into that duel\Nwithout a second thought
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri's bounty is worth over a billion.\NLuffy is making a tremendous wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we still have quite a way to go\Nwe're still in toto land after all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,stay sharp and alert Soon we'll\Nbe pursued once more by Big Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,an unbeatable emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And a fleet of enemy ships can close in\Non us from any direction at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So until we're able to escape the\Nterritory where Big Mom reigns,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't let our guard drop for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to Pedro's wishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies. I\Nsee now. I was out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami tell us what to do right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji and his group will be\Ncoming from Cacao Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll want to meet up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,High winds will be coming soon—try\Nto ride it hard to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan, Nami—we'll take\Nthe tailwind, starboard heading west!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Heading west. It's the most direct route.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go replenish the\Ncola we just used up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep a lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.39,0:06:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall monitor the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemies coming from six\No'clock. It's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,ships from earlier and a\Nperson no way seriously
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:07:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck! But how? What\Nkind of trick is this? Big Mom is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,walking across the water don't\Nbe silly that's completely absurd
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,is it not water wait a sec
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that's candy i think she's walking\Non a giant moving candy blob
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,wait can she do something\Nlike that oh no does that mean
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,there's only one person who has\Nthat power it's him isn't it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you lickety miss me keep\Nit up candy sea slug Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,where did our friend Zeus run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, this would\Nbe his responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrying mom, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I mind lending a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I do have a score to settle, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But Pedro's sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:07:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety-losing my right arm ain't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can just make a new one out of candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I do predict one minor\Ninconvenience, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I go to enjoy my\Nhot cup of afternoon tea,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.34,0:08:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll recall that damn mink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,as my lickety limb melts\Naway from the drink's heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing is more humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, what a heinous\Ncrime he has committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your payback by any means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This rage of mine must be sated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How shall I torment his friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did everyone else leave us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm losing my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:08:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I need fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love some thunderclouds about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola from Thriller Bark, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know she's a master of chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She was the minister of\Nchocolate running Cacao Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but she abandoned it when she ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And ever since then, that\Nposition has remained empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha, but why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready for this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's favorite little candidate right\Nhere keeps on rejecting the darn author.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell importing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I have my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The only person who should hold\Nthat seat is my big sister, Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still kind of holding out hope\Nthat she'll come back one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are my eyes deceiving me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.98,0:09:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that's my daughter up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tang, she didn't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.10,0:10:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, chiffon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you please just climb out\Nof the coffin already, Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be seen wearing a wedding\Ndress sitting next to that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want people to get\Nthe wrong impression about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll assume we're\Nnewlyweds heading out on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,our honeymoon and we\Nsimply can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What people you never know who's\Nprying eyes are watching, dear sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it just bothers me. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to cause you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't fall off. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you shut your mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So sweet. What a little prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:11:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you are, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fall if I want to, so just mind\Nyour own damn business, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see Cacao Island! Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner we get cracking on\Nthis cake, the better, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to\Nmy callous rebuke, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out this dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke his only way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, you plain hero by sacrificing\Nyourself for your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm gonna kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that stupid, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize who you're fighting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know General\NKatakuri's bounties?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One billion, fifty-seven million?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the toughest of the\Nsweet three generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bad technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Had to try it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think it's more\Nefficient to do it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Show that bastard what you're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That is brutal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:13:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But as I already told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing your powers can\Ndo that mine can't do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're inferior to me in\Nspeed, power, and efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Way rubber loses to Mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gomp-gomp-gomp-gomp-gomp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Straw Hat go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,General Katakuri's on a\Nwhole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're testing your strength next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn your lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That is one big fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How come? Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.56,0:14:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Redditories need a finger bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How was my elephant gun strong enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like an angel, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor thing—her wedding\Nwas completely ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it wrong that I think\Nshe's cute when she's sulking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because wow, it's the minister of?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Lady Siobhan here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She's under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She never hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The rebellion wasn't her idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.12,0:16:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She was only involved in\Nthis because of her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gang Veggie's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I told everyone that I was going to\Nforce you to help me make the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So we have to make it look believable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.18,0:16:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a traitor now, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, this really has been quite\Nthe day for you, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats invaded the\Nisland, Page betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to say it, but I guess that wedding\Nof yours just wasn't meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like that may\Nbe for the best, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That Sanji seems like a real jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can do is put that behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so brave, an inspiration to us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Mama's furious\Nabout this, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just furious—she's\Nsuffering from hunger pangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't satisfy her, she may\Ndestroy the entire country!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:16:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that's worrisome to hear—so\Nis everything ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We've called for 31 highly skilled\Nchefs to assist you on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They were dispatched from whole cake\Nisland an hour ago, so they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,they should
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day to you, Lady Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As you may have surmised, we are the\N31 head chefs of Whole Cake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the WCI 31 for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Siobhan and I are going to bake\Nthe only cake that can stop Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner we finish the\Njob, the more lives we save.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please provide us your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to report that we've\Nalready begun preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pudding suffered\Nmore than anyone today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet the only thing she's\Nthinking about is saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let Mama destroy\Nour country, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.86,0:18:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our heart is aching,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,she's turning all the sorrow into\Na delicious life-sitting cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a baking angel of\Nsalvation! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Robin go inside, while\Nthe crowd's focused on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask before I begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no exaggeration to say that our\Ncake will decide the fate of this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Countless lives are on the\Nline, so we need to concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.66,0:18:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, until we're done, you\Nmust stay out of the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even come close. Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And no peeking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you are\Nor what you might need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want absolute privacy. Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't hear a peek, Lady Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so sweet. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.62,0:18:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole island's cheering\Nfor you! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, now they won't see Sanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.94,0:19:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but dealing with the chefs will\Nbe a little more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chefs, please come inside one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Beach, head chef of the first\Nkitchen, reporting for duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This should only take a sec
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just giving your memories a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,edit
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you let me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumpy ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew a diagram of the wedding cake\Non the way here to speed things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.—The design is\None thing, but how do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The ingredients without
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,ever tasting
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.03,0:19:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,it by
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:20:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,its scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy now—let's hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Every last second counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.36,0:20:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,second counts
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Y 'all's a pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That chef outfit looks cute on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me Lady Pudding is not already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What a good husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here to help. Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I edited the memories of the chefs,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so they don't know about\Nthe whole wedding fiasco.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They think it went off without a hitch,\Nwhich would mean we're husband and wife now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, happy as can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So this story is, the wedding cake was\Nruined due to some unexpected weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama got angry, that's the same, so we\Nhave to make the cake all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't contradict their new memories, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.42,0:20:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The memories of when they made\Nthe original cake are still fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.66,0:20:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So with all of them here to help, we\Nshould be able to reproduce it accurately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:20:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who came up with this\Ndiagram for the wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And a recipe, too? That'd be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You sketched this out on\Nthe way over here? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me know if there's any mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This recipe is immaculate all\Nthe way down to the secret
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,ingredient Executive Chef Struzan's\Nbeen awake coming up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you were skilled,\Nbut I had no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You are brilliant, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Two newlywed chefs making\Ntheir own wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Romantic, huh? Newlywed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the unusual situation, but you\Nmight as well make the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't embarrass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, your wife fainted!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.16,0:21:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,His wife? Your wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wife! Your wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come help your wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're killing her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I really think gross!\NI think gross! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.32,0:21:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.23,0:21:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's bossing me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.50,0:21:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I like a man who\Nknows what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If he needs to wear the pants\Nin our relationship, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.56,0:22:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, mutual respect\Nis very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you talk down to me like that again,\Nand I swear I will skin your ass, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.72,0:22:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So here's what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Some non-homogenized milk,\Nsugar beets, and bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Also black sesame seeds,\Nsoy flour, and yogurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.84,0:22:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.54,0:22:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.98,0:22:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This job is life or death,\Nand it's a race against time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiffon, get baking on that\Ngiant chiffon cake immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.60,0:22:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, you start tempering the chocolate\Nand make sure we have enough of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.38,0:22:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm setting the cook time at\Ntwo hours and forty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't kidding when you\Ncalled this a race against time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Once everything else is done,\NI'll add my secret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll bring boundless\Njoy to whoever tastes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.40,0:22:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the essence of true sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.98,0:23:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, the essence of true sweetness, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.22,0:23:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In about three hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll load the partially done cake on\Na ship and depart from Cacao Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After it cools down a bit, we'll\Ndecorate it while we're sailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom and the Sunny\Nshould be heading our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and by the time they intercept us,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have the greatest cake ever\Nmade waiting for them. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds very efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That pace is going to be murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's impossible,\Nactually. Quiet, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.58,0:23:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it because the\Nalternative is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, we shall strive\Nto make the impossible possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.36,0:23:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to start baking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.50,0:23:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They saved Lola and I'll save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to protect Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This chiffon cake is going to be so\Nfluffy it'll bring the world to its knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.62,0:23:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the sweet chocolate of salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.72,0:23:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate that will change fate itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on just a little bit longer, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.60,0:24:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show them what I'm made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.82,0:24:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My chef spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.24,0:24:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.86,0:24:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Escaped from the jaws of death, Press.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.40,0:24:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,By the skin of my tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.48,0:24:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They really put on a sorry show.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro licked the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.86,0:24:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat, you saw it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.66,0:24:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried to sacrifice his worthless life\Nin some pathetic attempt to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.40,0:24:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm still lickety living.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.40,0:24:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see in other words, his\Ndeath was utterly lickety meaningless,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.32,0:24:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're going to die\Nin vain—just like he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.12,0:24:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So you just lickety lie there\Nand meet your maker quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.82,0:24:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you and Straw Hats\Nunderlings? They escaped our
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.48,0:24:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,encirclement by launching\Ntheir damned ship into the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.46,0:25:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama and I are chasing them down at this\Nvery moment, taking a stroll on the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.52,0:25:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying their best to escape,\Nbut we'll catch up, lickety split!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.82,0:25:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,split
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.34,0:25:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Amon's fleet will be here soon as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.16,0:25:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Katakuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.82,0:25:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can rest when this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.90,0:25:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our soldiers can't go\Nanywhere if you're napping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.32,0:25:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.23,0:25:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat thought he was taking\Na stand to save his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.28,0:25:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel, round up some of the soldiers\Nand set fire to Straw Hat's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.64,0:25:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.40,0:25:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.31,0:25:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We found a mirror that\Nlinks to the ship's locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.68,0:25:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.90,0:25:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more where that came from, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.10,0:25:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple of flaming arrows straight\Nthrough the mirror room should do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.34,0:25:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And while they're scrambling\Nto deal with the fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.40,0:25:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will smash those rats\Ninto itty-bitty pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.90,0:25:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.08,0:26:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over that mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.48,0:26:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lay a finger on my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.14,0:26:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we having a one-on-one\Nduel or not, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.62,0:26:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.22,0:26:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's burn down that ship\Nbefore someone interrupts us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.58,0:26:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.70,0:26:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll laugh if you miss, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.30,0:26:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.64,0:26:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.84,0:26:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.02,0:27:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.42,0:27:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.46,0:27:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my little siblings\Nyou're trying to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.34,0:27:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.68,0:27:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.00,0:27:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.02,0:27:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, Chopper, anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.34,0:27:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.82,0:27:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.18,0:27:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Ruthie?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.64,0:27:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.36,0:27:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm here. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.88,0:28:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to find all our mirrors. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.44,0:28:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Like in the bathroom or locker room? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.50,0:28:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn! Burn! Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.80,0:28:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for another one? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.82,0:28:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.16,0:28:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn! Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.22,0:28:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the mirrors?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.66,0:28:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Break them all! To pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.54,0:28:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how will you get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.06,0:28:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the whole plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.54,0:28:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.16,0:28:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get through this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.74,0:28:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll work something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.98,0:28:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.86,0:28:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.16,0:28:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I don't have a nose, Yo-Ho-Ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.86,0:28:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The room's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.54,0:28:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.36,0:28:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.74,0:28:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.65,0:28:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.56,0:29:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Flaming arrows from the mirror, cannon\Nshots from behind, one king after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.36,0:29:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had eyes in my sockets, I assure\Nyou they would be spinning right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.60,0:29:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.51,0:29:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put that fire out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.82,0:29:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.62,0:29:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,More arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.94,0:29:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard Barrel, Joscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.44,0:29:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,More arrows for fire, Pascar!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.36,0:29:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You two cut it out! That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.66,0:29:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.20,0:29:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.74,0:29:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee-hee-hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.62,0:29:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to storm the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.80,0:29:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.26,0:29:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Rawr! Rawr! Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.50,0:29:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.64,0:29:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.22,0:29:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.08,0:29:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Break the mirrors! Hurry! But...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.06,0:29:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're sending an army to attack you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.66,0:30:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.08,0:30:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.20,0:30:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take all I've got to\Nbeat the guy I'm fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.14,0:30:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.18,0:30:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.28,0:30:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.14,0:30:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.30,0:30:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.48,0:30:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.70,0:30:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.64,0:30:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.78,0:30:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this might be it for us.
